@startuml
note across
Scenario 0 – Default Map Visualization
"This scenario illustrates the initial map visualization displayed
when the application is loaded, before the user selects an origin
or destination."
end note

actor "User" as User
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Data Management" as DM
participant "Map Services" as MapAPI

User -> UI : Open application

UI -> API : I_HTTP_Map: mapRequest()

API -> DM : I_Map_View: getMapView(default area)
DM -> MapAPI : I_Map_Data_Access: fetchMapData(default area)
MapAPI --> DM : I_Map_Data_Access: MapData

DM --> API : I_Map_View: MapData

API --> UI : I_HTTP_Map:MapDataResponse

UI -> User : Display default city map
@enduml
